helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XV	Ús de la plataforma Java				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	ca-XV	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Ús de la plataforma Java\"\>Ús de la plataforma Java\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	ca-XV	L'$[officename] permet usar la plataforma Java per executar aplicacions i components basats en l'arquitectura JavaBeans.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	ca-XV	L'$[officename], per poder usar la plataforma Java, ha de disposar del programari Java 2 Runtime Environment. Durant la instal·lació de l'$[officename], se vos oferirà l'opció d'instal·lar estos fitxers si encara no es troben instal·lats. També podeu instal·lar-los ara si és necessari.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	ca-XV	Cal que activeu l'ús de la plataforma Java en l'$[officename] per executar aplicacions Java.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	ca-XV	Activeu l'ús de la plataforma Java des del menú \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferències\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Eines - Opcions\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	ca-XV	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	ca-XV	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XV	L'$[officename] i Internet				20200411 15:09:53
