helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105015				0	ca-XV	\<emph\>Fórmula\</emph\> obri l'%PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"text/smath/main0000.xhp\"\>Math\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011855				0	ca-XV	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>La icona Plantilles obri el diàleg Plantilles i documents.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
