helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149669				0	ca-XV	Guies en moure				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	ca-XV	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_GUIDELINE\"\>Especifica si cal mostrar les guies en moure dibuixos, marcs, gràfics i altres objectes.\</ahelp\> Estes guies vos ajuden a alinear objectes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358	38			0	ca-XV	Anses senzilles				20200411 15:09:53
