helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id9971922				0	ca-XV	Servidor intermediari HTTPS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id5319071				0	ca-XV	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Escriviu el nom del servidor intermediari per a HTTPS. Escriviu el port al camp de la dreta.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
