helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778813				0	ca-XV	CMYK				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778813				0	ca-XV	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the CMYK color model. CMYK refers to the four inks used in some color printing: cyan, magenta, yellow, and key (black).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778814				0	ca-XV	Cian				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778814				0	ca-XV	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Cyan\"\>Sets the Cyan color value in the CMYK color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
