helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	ca-XV	Mantingueu premuda la tecla \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Orde\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> i feu clic a la capçalera de fila				20200411 15:09:53
