helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id30				0	ca-XV	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Redueix o amplia la mida de la fórmula impresa per un factor especificat.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
