helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155602				0	ca-XV	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05050000.xhp\" name=\"Graella\"\>Graella\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	ca-XV	Obri un submenú que vos permet seleccionar la graella que vulgueu formatar.				20200411 15:09:53
