helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	ca-XV	Per als nombres senars, DOBLEFACT(n) retorna:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	ca-XV	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	ca-XV	DOBLEFACT(0) retorna 1 per definició.				20200411 15:09:53
