helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144906				0	ca-XV	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SIN\"\>Retorna el sinus de l'angle que s'ha indicat (en radians).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144923				0	ca-XV	Sintaxi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144937				0	ca-XV	SIN(Nombre)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144950				0	ca-XV	Retorna el sinus (trigonomètric) de \<emph\>Nombre\</emph\>, l'angle en radians.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8079470				0	ca-XV	Per calcular el sinus d'un angle en graus, utilitzeu la funció RADIANS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144969				0	ca-XV	Exemple				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144983				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SIN(PI()/2)\</item\> retorna 1, el sinus de PI/2 radians.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3916440				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SIN(RADIANS(30))\</item\> retorna 0,5, el sinus de 30 graus.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163397				0	ca-XV	\<bookmark_value\>funció SINH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
