helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152301				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(PI()/4) \</item\>retorna 1, la tangent de PI/4 radians.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1804864				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(RADIANS(45))\</item\> retorna 1, la tangent de 45 graus.				20200411 15:09:53
