helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164136				0	ca-XV	Sintaxi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164150				0	ca-XV	SIGNE(Nombre)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164164				0	ca-XV	\<emph\>Nombre\</emph\> és el nombre del qual es determinarà el signe.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164183				0	ca-XV	Exemple				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164197				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SIGNE(3,4)\</item\> retorna 1.				20200411 15:09:53
