helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156130				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PMTIACUM_ADD(0,0075;360;125000;13;24;0)\</item\> retorna -11135,23.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150764				0	ca-XV	Quin interés heu de pagar el primer mes?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3146857				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PMTIACUM_ADD(0,0075;360;125000;1;1;0)\</item\> retorna -937,50.				20200411 15:09:53
