helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150630				0	ca-XV	\<emph\>Taxa\</emph\> és la taxa de descompte d'un període.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150427				0	ca-XV	\<emph\>Valor1;...\</emph\> representen fins a 30 valors, que representen dipòsits o reintegraments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153538				0	ca-XV	Exemple				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154800				0	ca-XV	What is the net present value of periodic payments of 10, 20 and 30 currency units with a discount rate of 8.75%. At time zero the costs were paid as -40 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=VNA(8,75%;10;20;30)\</item\> = 49,43 unitats monetàries. El valor actual net és el valor retornat menys els costos inicials de 40 unitats monetàries, per tant 9,43 unitats monetàries.				20200411 15:09:53
