helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	ca-XV	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL_ADD(5,3543%;4)\</item\> retorna 0,0525 o 5,25%.				20200411 15:09:53
