helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145715				0	ca-XV	When you insert an object, graphic, or frame, an anchor icon appears where the item is anchored. You can position an anchored item by dragging the item to another location. To change the anchoring options of an item, right-click the item, and then choose an option from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
