helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3145110				0	ca-XV	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>. The name of the target is added to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
