helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152952				0	ca-XV	Estils				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150970				0	ca-XV	Per garantir una aparença uniforme per a les notes finals del document, assigneu-los un estil de paràgraf.				20200411 15:09:53
